#4. READ INTENSIVE APPLICATION KO KAISE SCALE KAREIN?   - READ REPLICAS
============================================================================

Maan lo application par read requests bahut zyada hain aur write requests comparatively kam hain.

Example (E-commerce):

    Product View          → Very Frequent (90% READ)
    Product Create/Update → Relatively Less Frequent (10% WRITE)

Initially system comfortably handle kar raha hota hai.

                Application
