## WRITE REQUEST FLOW
------------------------

Jab bhi Write Request aati hai, Application request se Shard Key ki value identify karti hai.
Us Shard Key par Shard Routing Logic apply karke pehle correct Shard identify kiya jaata hai.
Uske baad Write Request directly us Shard ke Primary Database par execute hoti hai.

Write successfully execute hone ke baad, Shard 2 ka Primary Database
apne corresponding Read Replicas ko data replicate karta hai.


## READ REQUEST FLOW
----------------------

Jab bhi Read Request aati hai, Application request se Shard Key ki value identify karti hai.
Us Shard Key par Shard Routing Logic apply karke pehle correct Shard identify kiya jaata hai.
Uske baad Application us particular Shard ke available Read Replicas mein se
kisi ek Replica ko select karti hai.

Selected Read Replica se data fetch karke Application response return kar deti hai.


